{"id": "EUVD-2026-108296", "enisaUuid": "5eaed497-dee3-3ce1-9393-6294ba78b3c2", "description": "Incus before 6.0.7, 6.1.0 before 7.0.2, and 7.1.0 before 7.5.0 contains a missing authorization vulnerability in GET /1.0/operations/{uuid} that lets project-restricted clients read operations in other projects. Attackers holding a restricted certificate and a known operation UUID can retrieve command lines, environment secrets, websocket secrets, and trust enrolment tokens.", "datePublished": "2026-10-22T19:13:43", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-22T19:13:43", "baseScore": 7.0, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:P/PR:L/UI:N/VC:H/VI:N/VA:N/SC:H/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/lxc/incus/security/advisories/GHSA-mfwv-x733-9446", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/incus-before-6.0.7-6.1.0-before-7.0.2-and-7.1.0-before-7.5.0-authorization-bypass-via-get-1.0-operations-uuid"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-115373", "GHSA-xv35-979f-75jf"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.0, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "0f5cb45b-2197-3bf8-a0e9-4392adac7609", "product": {"name": "incus", "vendor": {"name": "lxc"}}, "product_version": "6.1.0 <7.0.2"}, {"id": "3d4b18b2-82c5-343b-a018-62eb9ccca051", "product": {"name": "incus", "vendor": {"name": "lxc"}}, "product_version": "0 <6.0.7"}, {"id": "a079fc6b-54ed-39dc-93c7-6544af7a7b70", "product": {"name": "incus", "vendor": {"name": "lxc"}}, "product_version": "7.1.0 <7.5.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "38bb7291-51aa-3787-b195-10cba2c75f3d", "vendor": {"name": "lxc"}}], "isExploited": false}